{"availability":"available","full":"martianoff/gala","name":"gala","description":"Go, the functional way. Inspired by Scala: sealed types, exhaustive pattern matching, Option/Either/Try, bind/also do-notation, and compile-time data-race safety — transpiled to plain Go with full third-party module interop, zero-reflection JSON, and IDE tooling.","category":"Education","language":"Go","stars":55,"forks":2,"created":"2026-01-03T09:13:25Z","updated":"2026-10-04T05:35:11Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://gala.fyi/","topics":["algebraic-data-types","bazel","compiler","concurrency","data-race","do-notation","functional-programming","golang","immutable","monads","option-type","pattern-matching","programming-language","scala","sealed-types","static-typing","sum-types","transpiler","type-inference","type-safety"],"demo":"https://gala-playground.fly.dev/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:17:17.641Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:17:17.641Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:17:17.641Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:13:40.713Z","stars":55,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:17.641Z","stars":55,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Inspired by Scala: sum types, exhaustive pattern matching, and Option/Try — as a language that compiles to Go, not a library.","GALA is a statically typed, functional-first language that transpiles to Go. You get sealed types, exhaustive pattern matching, immutable collections, and a real monad stack (Option, Either, Try, Future, IO) — and you keep the entire Go ecosystem, including third-party modules, working out of the box.","It's aimed at Go developers who have used Scala, Kotlin, F#, or OCaml and miss the type system."],"features":["Sealed types with exhaustive matching. The compiler rejects incomplete matches at build time — including nested patterns, guards, and generic extractors. An incomplete match is a build error, not a production panic.","No nil. Option / Either / Try replace nil checks and naked error returns.","Compile-time data-race safety. A value crossing a goroutine boundary must be deeply immutable, and the compiler checks it — including what a closure captures. Because GALA is already immutable by default the check is…","Immutable by default. val bindings, immutable struct fields, read-only ConstPtr[T]; always concrete types, never a silent any.","Zero-reflection JSON. Codec[T] is backed by a compiler-generated StructMeta[T] intrinsic — no reflect, no struct tags, and it doubles as a pattern-match extractor."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/martianoff/gala/blob/master/README.MD","fingerprint":"b453c882458a70d580215ae77269c2cbd8f8a34954f7b38809b3b5231e8996a4","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:40.996Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:17:18.281Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Inspired by Scala: sum types, exhaustive pattern matching, and Option/Try — as a language that compiles to Go, not a library.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/martianoff/gala/blob/master/README.MD"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"b453c882458a70d580215ae77269c2cbd8f8a34954f7b38809b3b5231e8996a4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/martianoff/gala/blob/master/README.MD","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:17:18.282Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T05:35:11Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/martianoff/gala/blob/master/README.MD","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:17:18.284Z","hash":"b453c882458a70d580215ae77269c2cbd8f8a34954f7b38809b3b5231e8996a4","originalBytes":32987,"storedBytes":32987,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["gala","docs","val","immutable","type","case","code","string","future","int","config","func","port","bind","build","claude","error","lsp","name","types","value","every","host","match","plugin","run","try","json","path","pattern","flatmap","matching","return","struct","age","diagnostics","library","bazel","codec","errors","insta